	(text_box "Design Requirements:\n1) Vcc = 3.3V\n2) Vmon1 = 3.3V -5%\n3) Vmon2 = 1.8V - 5%\n4) Vmon3 = 1.8V - 5%\n5) Vmon4 = 1.0V +- 5%\n6) Start-up time = 300ms\n\nVoltage Rails:\n\nVmonx_tgt = (1 + RxH / RxL) * 0.4\nTODO: Fill out calcs here!\n\nStart-up time:\n- Pullup CT1-CT4 to VCC w/ 100k resistors forces fixed 300ms\n\nReset Logic:\n- If FPGA voltage rails fail, reset FPGA only\n- If MCU/RF frontend voltage rails fail, reset MCU (which subsequently resets FPGA and RF frontend on boot)\n- If MCU watchdog fails, reset MCU (repeat above)"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 240.03 15.24 0)
		(size 43.18 57.5409)
		(margins 0.9525 0.9525 0.9525 0.9525)
		(stroke
			(width 0)
			(type solid)
			(color 0 0 194 1)
		)
		(fill
			(type none)
		)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
				(color 0 0 194 1)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "33d045ee-e488-4039-a9cd-2b76811f9157")
	)
	(text_box "Separate LDO for supervisor circuit keeps things independent of downstream power rails."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 13.97 75.6268 0)
		(size 58.42 8.0376)
		(margins 0.9525 0.9525 0.9525 0.9525)
		(stroke
			(width 0)
			(type solid)
			(color 0 0 194 1)
		)
		(fill
			(type none)
		)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
				(color 0 0 194 1)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "35ece9d6-c629-4f1e-9630-7013beb38d7f")
	)
	(text_box "Soft Reset (active LOW): Resets E1 (which resets FPGA and RF frontend on boot)\n\nHard Reset (active HIGH): Power cycles regulators, restarts power sequence"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 13.97 184.15 0)
		(size 44.45 12.1268)
		(margins 0.9525 0.9525 0.9525 0.9525)
		(stroke
			(width 0)
			(type solid)
			(color 0 0 194 1)
		)
		(fill
